# Messaging

- Broker: **RabbitMQ** (not Kafka). Contracts: `IntegrationEventExchanges`, `IntegrationEventRoutingKeys`.
- Write path: same UoW as business data → `IOutboxWriter.EnqueueAsync` → owning service `AddFgsOutboxPublisher` poller → `IIntegrationEventPublisher` (RabbitMQ default).
- Outbox tables: `tenant.TenantOutboxMessage`, `glo.GloOutboxMessage`, `setup.SetupOutboxMessage`, `inventory.InventoryOutboxMessage`, `crm.CrmOutboxMessage` (CRM has no worker yet).
- Consume in **ConsumerService** only (clone existing `Process*CommandHandler`). Idempotency: Redis `IConsumerIdempotencyStore` (no inbox table).
- Hosted services: resolve `IMediator` in a scope; no business logic in the poller.
- Details: [docs/ai/messaging.md](../../docs/ai/messaging.md), [docs/ai/outbox.md](../../docs/ai/outbox.md).
